{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45523","headline":"酬沈先辈卷 · 归仁","name":"酬沈先辈卷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一百八十首，清泠韵可敲。\n任从人不爱，终是我难抛。\n桂魄吟来满，蒲团坐得凹。\n先生声价在，寰宇几人抄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"归仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45523.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45523","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}